  "title": "jQuery CSS Styles",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "h1",
      "text": "jQuery CSS Styles"
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "jQuery vs JavaScript"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "jQuery was created in 2006 by John Resig.\nIt was designed to handle Browser Incompatibilities and to simplify HTML DOM Manipulation, Event Handling, Animations, and Ajax."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "However, after JavaScript Version 5 (2009), most of the jQuery utilities can be solved with a few lines of standard JavaScript:"
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "Hiding HTML Elements"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Hide an HTML Element:"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "lang": "js",
      "text": "myElement.hide();",
      "caption": "jQuery"
    },
    {
      "type": "tryit",
      "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=tryjs_jquery_hide"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "lang": "js",
      "text": "myElement.style.display = \"none\";",
      "caption": "JavaScript"
    },
    {
      "type": "tryit",
      "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=tryjs_jquery_style_hide"
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "Showing HTML Elements"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Show an HTML Element:"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "lang": "js",
      "text": "myElement.show();",
      "caption": "jQuery"
    },
    {
      "type": "tryit",
      "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=tryjs_jquery_show"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "lang": "js",
      "text": "myElement.style.display = \"\";",
      "caption": "JavaScript"
    },
    {
      "type": "tryit",
      "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=tryjs_jquery_style_show"
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "Styling HTML Elements"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Change the font size of an HTML element:"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "lang": "js",
      "text": "$(\"#demo\").css(\"font-size\",\"35px\");",
      "caption": "jQuery"
    },
    {
      "type": "tryit",
      "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=tryjs_jquery_css"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "lang": "js",
      "text": "document.getElementById(\"demo\").style.fontSize = \"35px\";",
      "caption": "JavaScript"
    },
    {
      "type": "tryit",
      "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=tryjs_jquery_style_css"
    }
  ]
}
